{"id":364,"title":"Fill Between填充曲线间区域","summary":"在本课中，我们将学习如何使用fill_between来填充两条曲线之间的区域。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b2131cf3-6cf6-42a3-8505-d011ed48e838","text":"有时，我们想填充两条曲线之间的区域，特别是当这些区域处于不同的象限时，我们想用不同的颜色来填充它们。例如，在画一条$sin(x)$的曲线时，我们可能希望在x轴的顶部和底部用不同的颜色来填充。\n\n另一个更实际的例子是，当我们用一条直线拟合一些数据点时，我们可能想为我们的直线画一个置信区，类似于我们可能使用的`errorbar`图。\n\n为了绘制置信区，要调用的基本函数是`fill_between()`。下面是该函数需要的一些重要参数。\n\n\n- `x`：曲线的节点的x坐标。\n- `y1`：第一条曲线的节点的y坐标。\n- `y2`：第二条曲线的节点的y坐标。\n- `where`: bool数组。定义排除某些水平区域被填充的位置。例如，如果$where[i]$和$where[i+1]$为True，则填充$x[i]$和$x[i+1]$之间。","text_html":"<p>有时，我们想填充两条曲线之间的区域，特别是当这些区域处于不同的象限时，我们想用不同的颜色来填充它们。例如，在画一条<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sin(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>的曲线时，我们可能希望在x轴的顶部和底部用不同的颜色来填充。</p>\n<p>另一个更实际的例子是，当我们用一条直线拟合一些数据点时，我们可能想为我们的直线画一个置信区，类似于我们可能使用的<code>errorbar</code>图。</p>\n<p>为了绘制置信区，要调用的基本函数是<code>fill_between()</code>。下面是该函数需要的一些重要参数。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>x</code>：曲线的节点的x坐标。</li>\n<li><code>y1</code>：第一条曲线的节点的y坐标。</li>\n<li><code>y2</code>：第二条曲线的节点的y坐标。</li>\n<li><code>where</code>: bool数组。定义排除某些水平区域被填充的位置。例如，如果<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">where[i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02691em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">where[i+1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02691em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>为True，则填充<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x[i]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x[i+1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>之间。</li>\n</ul>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e4370af2-c74f-4b2d-bcb8-b91a2f56528e","text":"## 小试牛刀\n\n从下面的例子代码中我们可以看到，`x`轴的范围是`[0, 4]`。\u001e$y1=sin(x)$，参数没给出$y2$表示填充x轴与y1之间的区域，你也可以理解为$y2=0$ ","text_html":"<h2>小试牛刀</h2>\n<p>从下面的例子代码中我们可以看到，<code>x</code>轴的范围是<code>[0, 4]</code>。\u001e<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y1=sin(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，参数没给出<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8388800000000001em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span></span>表示填充x轴与y1之间的区域，你也可以理解为<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y2=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8388800000000001em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span></span></span></span></p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"60dda046-60f8-4c8c-b794-1b75d20a4b2f","title":"","caption":"简单的填充","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport numpy as np\n\nx = np.arange(0, 4, 0.01)\ny1 = np.sin(x*np.pi)\n\nfig, axe = plt.subplots(dpi=300)\naxe.fill_between(x, y1,facecolor='g', alpha=0.6)\n\nfig.savefig(\"output/output.png\")\nplt.close(fig)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"8","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fac925f2-658a-4a56-a477-76fd4a8a75d7","text":"## 条件填充\n\n正如我们在本课开始时提到的，我们可以用不同的颜色来填充X轴的顶部和底部。为了用不同的颜色来填充这些区域，我们可以使用`where`。在下面的示例代码中，由于我们在第8行设置了`where=(y1 > 0)`，所以y轴大于0的区域被填充为绿色。因为我们在第9行设置了`where=(y1 < 0)`，所以y轴小于0的区域被填上了红色。\n\n```python\naxe.fill_between(x, y1, where=(y1 > 0), facecolor='g', alpha=0.6)\naxe.fill_between(x, y1, where=(y1 < 0), facecolor='r', alpha=0.6)\n```","text_html":"<h2>条件填充</h2>\n<p>正如我们在本课开始时提到的，我们可以用不同的颜色来填充X轴的顶部和底部。为了用不同的颜色来填充这些区域，我们可以使用<code>where</code>。在下面的示例代码中，由于我们在第8行设置了<code>where=(y1 &gt; 0)</code>，所以y轴大于0的区域被填充为绿色。因为我们在第9行设置了<code>where=(y1 &lt; 0)</code>，所以y轴小于0的区域被填上了红色。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">axe.fill_between(x, y1, where=(y1 &gt; 0), facecolor='g', alpha=0.6)\naxe.fill_between(x, y1, where=(y1 &lt; 0), facecolor='r', alpha=0.6)\n</code></pre>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"562a87c6-5d65-4be9-b5bb-f75c68fca970","title":"","caption":"条件填充","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport numpy as np\n\nx = np.arange(0, 4, 0.01)\ny1 = np.sin(x*np.pi)\n\nfig, axe = plt.subplots(dpi=300)\naxe.fill_between(x, y1, where=(y1 > 0), facecolor='g', alpha=0.6)\naxe.fill_between(x, y1, where=(y1 < 0), facecolor='r', alpha=0.6)\nfig.savefig(\"output/output.png\")\nplt.close(fig)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"8 9","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"375c2945-80e2-4233-8464-e6a647717160","text":"## 绘制置信带\n\n\n参照下方代码学习主要步骤：\n\n- 第1步：准备数据(代码第4-5行)\n\n- 第2步：拟合数据。NumPy提供了一个有用的函数`polyfit`。在我们的线性数据集上，我们可以拟合斜率和截距。(代码第7行)\n\n>提示：`polyfit`是最小二乘法的拟合，它是一个多项式$p(x) = p[0]*x^{0} + p[1]*x^{1} ...+p[n]$到点$(x, y)$。Polyfit返回一个系数向量$p$使得平方误差最小。更多的细节可以操考[Matplotlib官方网站](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.polyfit.html)。\n\n- 第3步：根据`a`和`b`得到一个估计曲线。(代码第8行)\n\n- 第4步：计算误差。(代码第9行)\n\n- 第5步：通过使用`fill_between()`来画图。填充区域在$y_{est} - y_{err}$和$y_{est} + y_{err}$之间。(代码第14行)\n\n> 注意：理解下面代码的难点是置信区间的计算，而不是如何填充置信区间。置信区间计算可以[参考百科](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E7%BD%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%8C%BA%E9%97%B4/7442583?fr=aladdin)。","text_html":"<h2>绘制置信带</h2>\n<p>参照下方代码学习主要步骤：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>第1步：准备数据(代码第4-5行)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>第2步：拟合数据。NumPy提供了一个有用的函数<code>polyfit</code>。在我们的线性数据集上，我们可以拟合斜率和截距。(代码第7行)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>提示：<code>polyfit</code>是最小二乘法的拟合，它是一个多项式<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x) = p[0]*x^{0} + p[1]*x^{1} ...+p[n]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141079999999999em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.064108em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>到点<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x, y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。Polyfit返回一个系数向量<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">p</span></span></span></span>使得平方误差最小。更多的细节可以操考<a href=\"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.polyfit.html\">Matplotlib官方网站</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>第3步：根据<code>a</code>和<code>b</code>得到一个估计曲线。(代码第8行)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>第4步：计算误差。(代码第9行)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>第5步：通过使用<code>fill_between()</code>来画图。填充区域在<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{est} - y_{err}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.58333em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.7777700000000001em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span></span></span></span>和<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{est} + y_{err}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.58333em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.7777700000000001em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">y</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span></span></span></span>之间。(代码第14行)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注意：理解下面代码的难点是置信区间的计算，而不是如何填充置信区间。置信区间计算可以<a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E7%BD%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%8C%BA%E9%97%B4/7442583?fr=aladdin\">参考百科</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a99c402b-e8c2-491e-a824-d6b01ab796b1","title":"","caption":"置信区间","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport numpy as np\n\nx = np.linspace(0, 10, 11)\ny = [3.9, 4.4, 10.8, 10.3, 11.2, 13.1, 14.1,  9.9, 13.9, 15.1, 12.5]\n\na, b = np.polyfit(x, y, deg=1)\ny_est = a * x + b\ny_err = x.std() * np.sqrt(1/len(x) +\n                          (x - x.mean())**2 / np.sum((x - x.mean())**2))\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(dpi=800)\nax.plot(x, y_est, '-')\nax.fill_between(x, y_est - y_err, y_est + y_err, alpha=0.2)\nax.plot(x, y, 'o')\nfig.savefig(\"output/output.png\")\nplt.close(fig)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":6}],"status":"undo","course_no":"008","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/008/page/364"}
